{"v":4,"catch":"以菲律賓神話生物為特色的菲律賓探索遊戲","desc":"歡迎來到 1890 年代的蒸氣龐克菲律賓\n以菲律賓神話為藍本，有神秘怪物在馬尼拉遊蕩，\n你扮演「紅領巾人」的角色\n探索神秘的豪宅並發現這場噩夢背後的真相\n\n-靈感源自 90 年代 16 位藝術風格\n從人物到背景全部創作\n像素藝術風格\n就像之前的第 4 代遊戲機一樣\n\n- 探索豪宅以解鎖其他房間\n\n- 升級系統，讓你的對手擁有更多優勢\n\n- 解鎖額外的遊戲模式","publisher":"Singles Alliance","release":"2024-06-13","genres":["動作","冒險","其他","角色扮演"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.7GB / Switch 0.7GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/457e3c2f6aca0d3ee39672a83a74e54fc5c11b1240f11a3b9efadaf6e0b07972.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c09ae2d3c932703dc4ac260e84e876e73dd149792fed0219639233fcb20fd4e2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/628f3e39bc6d9be417336ac6b07ae077cc8ceafd20640c53a8534c5ea01291af.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ad4d176d335b94cee582920dee24782edeff91d41bc7d4e1a1720c6a62045859.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e8c20f3c60b37a202a25df3bee9b0e5cac1e7506eacca8592e39c01d0485a2c9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a8f81670633e10785f830fd2964fb134de360924c78be017c5e777a8eb3c7cb4.jpg"],"titleId":"0100f3a01e512000","dlc":[]}